  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BRIDGE: Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning Services to the Humanitarian Division 2025 (Global)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment provides Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning (MEL) technical advisory services to the Humanitarian Division, in response to immediate needs in 2025. Activities include:
a)	Discrete technical MEL tasks, such as After Action Reviews of Australia&apos;s humanitarian responses;
b)	Expert MEL advice;
c)	MEL quality reporting analysis and support;
d)	Ongoing MEL capacity building and support.</narrative>
  </description>
